496
00:42:46,264 --> 00:42:53,864
アキちゃん今日は誘ってくれてありがとう！またね、1期生のみんなでこの曲が歌えてメルはとっても嬉しかったです。
Aki-chan, thanks for inviting me today! I'm so happy we all got to sing this song together as 1st gen.

497
00:42:53,864 --> 00:43:04,264
そしてメルも5月13日に活動4周年を迎えました！まだ3D配信はできていないんですが、予定はあるのでみんなお楽しみに！
And Mel also celebrated her 4th anniversary on May 13th! I haven't done my 3D stream yet, but I have plans so look forward to it!

498
00:43:04,264 --> 00:43:13,264
はい、次ハートちゃん！はい、6月2日21時から記念配信するから見に来てね！そして今日はアキちゃんおめでとう！
Yes, next is Haato-chan! Yes, I'm having my anniversary stream on June 2nd at 9 PM, so come watch! And congratulations today, Aki-chan!

499
00:43:13,264 --> 00:43:17,864
ありがとう！次ふぶきちゃん！
Thank you! Next is Fubuki-chan!

500
00:43:17,864 --> 00:43:29,864
はい、6月3日からなと、白上も記念配信があります！よろしくお願いしますよーい！
Yes, starting June 3rd, Nato, Shirakami will also have an anniversary stream! Please look forward to it!

501
00:43:29,864 --> 00:43:32,864
ありがとう！そしてまつりちゃん！
Thank you! And Matsuri-chan!

502
00:43:32,864 --> 00:43:40,864
はい、えーっと、6月4日に記念配信を予定しております！よろしくお願いします！
Yes, um, I'm planning my anniversary stream on June 4th! Please look forward to it!

503
00:43:40,864 --> 00:43:49,864
はい、ありがとう！はい、ということでいっぱい盛り上げてくれると嬉しいです。みんなありがとねー！
Yes, thank you! So we'd be happy if you get super hyped. Thank you everyone!

504
00:43:49,864 --> 00:44:02,064
バイバイ！じゃあ次は無口で3Dなんだな(笑) 無口でね、だね！あ、まつりちゃんはお残し、お残しだよ。
Bye-bye! Next is Mukuchi in 3D (laughs) Mukuchi, right! Ah, Matsuri-chan is leaving leftovers, leftovers!

505
00:44:02,064 --> 00:44:12,564
サマローズで歌おうと思って、お！サマローズオッケー！最後までいきましょう！ドキドキするけど楽しみ！
Thinking of singing it at Summer Rose, oh! Summer Rose okay! Let's go till the end! I'm nervous but looking forward to it!

506
00:44:25,564 --> 00:44:29,864
「またね」と笑って見せてくれた
You smiled and told me, "See you later,"

507
00:44:29,864 --> 00:44:36,264
同じように笑い返していたのに気づけば
and I smiled right back just like you, but before I knew it,

508
00:44:36,264 --> 00:44:40,864
少し滲んでいた あなたの姿
your figure was slightly blurred with tears.

509
00:44:46,564 --> 00:44:51,864
あれからいくつ夜を越えた
How many nights have passed since then?

510
00:44:51,864 --> 00:44:59,564
窓越しの白い画面に映ったあなたと見たい景色を今もずっとずっと見つめたまま
I'm still gazing at the scenery I wanted to see with you, reflected on the white screen across the window...

511
00:45:01,364 --> 00:45:09,152
きょうも 今も ずっと ずっと 見つめたまま
Today and right now, gazing at you forever and ever...

512
00:45:11,004 --> 00:45:15,384
降りしきる雪が積もるように
Like snow falling and piling up,

513
00:45:16,204 --> 00:45:20,064
この街で ただあなたを思う
In this town, I simply think of you.

514
00:45:20,904 --> 00:45:30,124
離れていても 同じ空が どうか 見えてますように
Even apart, I hope the same sky is visible to you...

515
00:45:40,824 --> 00:45:44,844
胸を打つ やさしい声が響く
A gentle voice that strikes my heart echoes,

516
00:45:45,304 --> 00:45:51,104
耳元に あなたが残したしじま
In my ear, the silence you left behind...

517
00:45:51,664 --> 00:45:58,824
世界が 切り離された夜 また目を潤す
On a night when the world was cut off, my eyes grow moist once more.

518
00:46:02,404 --> 00:46:07,064
くだらないことにずっと 幸せを感じてた きっと
We always felt happy over trivial things, surely.

519
00:46:07,544 --> 00:46:11,644
特別じゃない日々を もっと 二人でただ過ごしたくて
Wanting to spend more ordinary days together just the two of us,

520
00:46:12,244 --> 00:46:17,524
季節が何度変わろうと 隣にいたよね それ以上何もいらないから
No matter how many seasons change, you were right beside me—I needed nothing more than that.

521
00:46:23,044 --> 00:46:27,464
降りしきる雪が積もるように
Like snow falling and piling up,

522
00:46:28,184 --> 00:46:32,344
遠い街で ただあなたを思う
In a distant town, I simply think of you.

523
00:46:33,144 --> 00:46:38,944
触れ合うことができなくても 変わることなく
Even if we cannot touch, unchangingly,

524
00:46:42,364 --> 00:46:46,444
何度だってそう 振り返れば あの日のあなたの
No matter how many times, yes, if I look back, your words and voice from that day...

525
00:46:47,864 --> 00:46:52,184
言葉が 声が 会いたくなるんだよ
Make me want to see you so badly.

526
00:46:53,064 --> 00:47:01,344
何度だってそう 信じ合えれば いつまでも二人 繋がっていられる
No matter how many times, if we believe in each other, we can stay connected forever.

527
00:47:05,244 --> 00:47:10,164
雪あかり照らす この街にも
Even upon this town illuminated by snowlight,

528
00:47:10,664 --> 00:47:15,384
いつかは優しい 春が訪れる
A gentle spring will one day arrive.

529
00:47:16,404 --> 00:47:24,564
ここでまた会えたその時は 涙零さないように
When we meet again here, so I won't spill tears,

530
00:47:26,484 --> 00:47:30,664
冬の終わりを告げる 歌よ
O song that announces the end of winter,

531
00:47:31,044 --> 00:47:37,624
その一瞬に願いを乗せる どんな季節も景色も あなたと共に
I place my wish in that single moment—every season and scenery, together with you.

532
00:47:43,584 --> 00:47:47,484
同じ場所で感じていたい
I want to feel them in the same place.

533
00:47:48,244 --> 00:47:53,804
街に柔らかい風が吹いて 鮮やかな花が咲くその日を
As a soft wind blows through the town, the day when vibrant flowers bloom,

534
00:47:54,384 --> 00:47:59,764
待ち続ける二人にも ああ 春が訪れるように
I pray spring will visit the two of us who keep waiting...

535
00:48:04,444 --> 00:48:13,804
笑顔で また会えますように
So we may meet again with a smile.

536
00:48:50,052 --> 00:48:55,552
歌よ 作詞:中村佳穂 作曲:Ludvig Forssell
[Song: Uta yo | Lyrics: Kaho Nakamura | Music: Ludvig Forssell]

537
00:50:22,373 --> 00:50:25,073
歌よ 導いて
O song, guide me.

538
00:50:42,873 --> 00:50:47,873
こんな小さなメロディが
Such a tiny melody

539
00:50:47,873 --> 00:50:55,273
貫いてく 世界が見たいの
piercing through—I want to see that world.

540
00:50:56,273 --> 00:51:01,273
毎朝起きて 探してる
Every morning I wake up and search

541
00:51:02,073 --> 00:51:09,573
あなたのいない未来は 想像したくない
I don't want to imagine a future without you.

542
00:51:10,073 --> 00:51:12,873
いやなの
I hate it.

543
00:51:13,073 --> 00:51:16,073
でももういない 世界がわかんない
You're gone, and I don't understand this world.

544
00:51:16,273 --> 00:51:19,273
私以外 うまくいってるみたい
It seems everyone else is doing fine.

545
00:51:19,573 --> 00:51:24,073
それでもあしたは来る
Still, tomorrow will come.

546
00:51:24,073 --> 00:51:27,573
どれだけの…
Just how much...

547
00:51:28,573 --> 00:51:32,573
歌よ 導いて！
O song, guide me!

548
00:51:33,873 --> 00:51:39,073
闇になる みな幸せなの
Turning into darkness—is everyone happy?

549
00:51:42,873 --> 00:51:47,573
愛している 人がいるの
Is there someone you love?

550
00:51:48,073 --> 00:51:51,573
こうして 一人でいると
When I'm all alone like this,

551
00:51:52,073 --> 00:51:56,573
不安になる 歌よ
I grow afraid, O song.

552
00:51:57,073 --> 00:52:03,573
導いて どんなことが起きてもいい
Guide me, no matter what happens.

553
00:52:08,573 --> 00:52:10,573
歌よ
O song,

554
00:52:12,073 --> 00:52:14,873
そばにいて
stay by my side.

555
00:52:16,073 --> 00:52:22,073
愛よ 近づいて
O love, draw near.

556
00:52:31,073 --> 00:52:37,573
きらめきの花 夢の宝石 世界は美しい
Sparkling flowers, jewels of dreams—the world is beautiful.

557
00:52:46,073 --> 00:52:54,073
怯えと不安 縛られるけれど
Though bound by fear and anxiety,

558
00:52:55,073 --> 00:53:00,573
強く優しく なれたなら
if I could become strong and kind...

559
00:53:01,573 --> 00:53:04,573
あの空は 戻らない
That sky will never return.

560
00:53:05,073 --> 00:53:09,573
ひとりでは 生きてられない
I cannot live all by myself.

561
00:53:10,073 --> 00:53:14,573
会いたい もう一度
I want to see you once more;

562
00:53:15,073 --> 00:53:19,573
胸の奥ふるえている
deep within my chest, I'm trembling.

563
00:53:20,573 --> 00:53:26,573
ここにいるよ とどいて
I'm right here, please reach out—

564
00:53:27,573 --> 00:53:32,073
はなれてはならない 君へ
to you, from whom I must never part.

565
00:53:33,073 --> 00:53:39,573
目を閉じた時にだけ 会えるなんて 信じない
I won't believe I can only meet you when I close my eyes.

566
00:53:40,073 --> 00:53:46,573
はなれてはならない 君へ
To you, from whom I must never part...

567
00:53:48,573 --> 00:53:53,073
会いたい
I want to see you—

568
00:53:54,073 --> 00:54:00,573
はなれてはならない 君へ
to you, from whom I must never part.

569
00:54:03,073 --> 00:54:06,573
きらめきの花 夢の宝石
Sparkling flowers, jewels of dreams,

570
00:54:07,073 --> 00:54:11,073
世界は美しい
the world is beautiful.

571
00:54:15,573 --> 00:54:20,573
ひとりでは 生きてられない
I cannot live all by myself.

572
00:54:23,073 --> 00:54:26,573
会いたい もう一度
I want to see you once more.

573
00:54:43,073 --> 00:54:48,073
ここにいるよ とどいて
I'm right here, please reach out—

574
00:54:49,073 --> 00:55:00,073
はなれてはならない 君へ
to you, from whom I must never part.

575
00:55:01,507 --> 00:55:04,327
一人にして欲しいと
"I just want you to be alone," you say,

576
00:55:04,327 --> 00:55:07,927
あなたは突き放すけれど
pushing me away, but

577
00:55:07,927 --> 00:55:15,127
本当は胸の中にあるものを 覗かれたくないのでしょう？
surely you don't want me to see what's truly inside your heart, right?

578
00:55:16,447 --> 00:55:18,947
夜が
Night

579
00:55:19,547 --> 00:55:24,647
また訪れるのだけどね
falls upon us once again, but...

580
00:55:25,547 --> 00:55:33,047
あなた あなたは どんなあなたでも
No matter what kind of person you are,

581
00:55:33,547 --> 00:55:42,247
見たいと いつも考えてしまう
I always find myself wanting to see you.

582
00:55:48,247 --> 00:55:51,247
聞かせて
Let me hear

583
00:55:51,247 --> 00:55:57,047
隠そうとする あなたの顔を
the face you try to hide,

584
00:55:57,247 --> 00:56:06,247
見せて 隠れてしまう あなたの心
let me see the heart you keep hidden away.

585
00:56:13,047 --> 00:56:22,147
聞かせて どんなことからでもいい 最後まで聞くから
Let me hear it, no matter what it is, I'll listen to the very end.

586
00:56:22,847 --> 00:56:32,647
開いて 傍に行きたい あなたの心
Open up, I want to be by your side, your heart.

587
00:56:34,047 --> 00:56:38,847
ララ、ララ、ララ、ララ…
La-la, la-la, la-la, la-la...

588
00:56:39,247 --> 00:56:45,347
あなたの 心
Your heart...

589
00:56:46,147 --> 00:56:53,647
聞かせて
Let me hear it...

590
00:57:56,394 --> 00:58:00,894
そっと開いたドアの向こうに
Beyond the door you opened softly

591
00:58:00,894 --> 00:58:05,594
壊れそうな世界はある
Lies a world that seems to be destroyed

592
00:58:06,194 --> 00:58:10,194
朝が来るのか 夜になるのか
Will the morning come? Will it become night?

593
00:58:10,194 --> 00:58:15,594
迷いながら ひかりは澱んで
As you lose your way the light breaks through

594
00:58:16,194 --> 00:58:20,094
声が呼ぶまでは もう少し遊ぼう
Let's play a little longer until the voice calls for me,

595
00:58:20,494 --> 00:58:25,494
花のように廻る時間を繰り返し
Repeating the time that revolves like a flower

596
00:58:25,494 --> 00:58:34,594
夢はこの部屋の中で 優しい歌をずっと君に歌っていた
Dreams were always singing a gentle song to you here in this room

597
00:58:40,194 --> 00:58:45,294
何がほんとのことなの
What is the truth?

598
00:58:45,294 --> 00:58:54,094
一番強く信じられる世界を 追いかけて 君の銀の庭へ
Chase after the world that you can believe in the most to your silver garden

599
00:59:24,294 --> 00:59:33,294
道に迷ったあの子が今日も 一番早く帰り着いた
The girl who lost her way today too came home the earliest

600
00:59:34,294 --> 00:59:43,294
正しさよりも明るい場所を 見つけながら走ればいいんだね
She should run while finding a place brighter than righteousness, right?

601
00:59:47,894 --> 00:59:52,894
幼い眠りを守りたい番人
The guard who wants to protect your childish slumber

602
00:59:52,894 --> 00:59:59,894
大人になる門は固く閉ざされて
Keeps the gate to becoming an adult tightly closed

603
01:00:07,818 --> 01:00:11,268
君は気付いていたかな
Had you noticed?

604
01:00:11,568 --> 01:00:16,468
本当のことなんて いつも過去にしかない
That the truth is always left in the past?

605
01:00:16,798 --> 01:00:21,218
未来や希望は 全て 誰かが描く遠い庭の我が儘な物語
Future and hope are all selfish tales of a faraway garden drawn by someone else

606
01:00:32,409 --> 01:00:37,579
まだ誰も知らない ひたむきな小鳥の声で歌う子供は
The children singing with the voice of an earnest little bird that no one knows yet

607
01:00:37,869 --> 01:00:47,449
何を隠し 何を壊し 燃える時計
What are they hiding, what are they destroying, a burning clock

608
01:00:47,615 --> 01:00:53,459
秘密めく花の香り
The secret scent of flowers

609
01:00:53,859 --> 01:00:57,999
ここにいるよ
"I am right here."

610
01:01:06,301 --> 01:01:10,241
静かに寄り添って 何処にも行かないで
Nestling close quietly, please don't go anywhere

611
01:01:10,401 --> 01:01:14,711
窓辺で囁いて 何処にも行かないで
Whispering by the window, please don't go anywhere

612
01:01:20,980 --> 01:01:24,350
夢はその腕の中に
Dreams lie in those arms

613
01:01:24,350 --> 01:01:30,100
優しい人の嘘も 嘆きも閉じ込めていたか
Locking away the lies and grievances of kind people

614
01:01:30,790 --> 01:01:34,360
何か足りない心で
With a heart that is lacking something

615
01:01:34,360 --> 01:01:40,110
光を纏い飛んで行こう 少女のかたちをして
Let us bask in the light and take off, taking the form of a little girl

616
01:01:41,070 --> 01:01:46,530
終わらない始まりへ 本当の終わりへ
Towards the never-ending beginning, towards the true ending

617
01:01:59,863 --> 01:02:03,853
静かに寄り添って 何処にも行かないで
Nestling close quietly, please don't go anywhere

618
01:02:03,853 --> 01:02:07,693
窓辺で囁いて 何処にも行かないで
Whispering by the window, please don't go anywhere

619
01:02:47,575 --> 01:02:54,755
本日はアキロゼ4周年ライブ「ROSE of the LAMP」1週間でしたかー？
How was the first week of Aki Rosenthal's 4th Anniversary Live, "ROSE of the LAMP"?

620
01:02:55,785 --> 01:03:06,215
はい！それではかっこいいオープニングから始まり、たくさんたくさん楽しませていただきました！5年目も活動頑張っていきたいと思うので応援よろしくお願いします！
Yes! Starting with a really cool opening, I had so much fun! I want to keep working hard in my 5th year, so I'd appreciate your support!

621
01:03:07,625 --> 01:03:09,685
さあ、ここで超ハッピーなお知らせ！
Now, here is a super happy announcement!

622
01:03:09,915 --> 01:03:15,615
4周年を記念してスペシャルなグッズを作らせていただきました！
We've made some special goods to commemorate the 4th anniversary!

623
01:03:15,615 --> 01:03:27,655
今回のライブ＆新曲「ROSE of the LAMP」のロゴをモチーフにしたアクリルキーホルダー＆ステッカー、＆新曲ビジュアルのブランケットはシヒロアヤカ先生描き下ろしです！是非ゲットしてね！
Featuring the acrylic keychain & sticker with the logo of our live & new song "ROSE of the LAMP," and the new song visual blanket drawn by Shihiro Ayaka-sensei! Be sure to get them!

624
01:03:28,535 --> 01:03:32,175
あれ？これは噂のアキロゼ睡眠事件？
Huh? Is this the rumored Aki Rosenthal sleeping incident?

625
01:03:32,175 --> 01:03:42,625
この黒Tシャツを着て、この後はメンバーシップ限定のアルコールアンコールライブにレッツゴー！ばいばーい！
Put on this black T-shirt and let's go to the membership-only alcohol encore live right after this! Bye-bye!

